{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124378","id":4819330463,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH0Elnw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124378","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124378.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124378.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124378","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124378/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124378/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124378/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d6b16e695b0d8a01d2aa81489c94e0bbcd24c26a","number":124378,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Forward+: skip post-transparent MSAA resolve when not needed","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nNone, as in, no open issues. That aside, it improves Forward+ MSAA performance.\n\n## Additional information\n\n<!--\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\n-->\n\nChanges `RenderForwardClustered::_render_scene` to avoid performing a second, possibly expensive post-transparent MSAA resolve when that resolve output is not used by anything. Currently the only users of that buffer are:\n- TAA\n- FSR\n- DOF\n- post-transparent compositor effects, only if they ask for a resolved depth buffer\n\nIn practice, this PR improves performance of MSAA in the Forward+ renderer when none of the above effects is enabled, with larger improvements at higher MSAA levels:\n\n| mode | PR                 | master             |\n|------|--------------------|--------------------|\n|   8x |  7.25mspf (138fps) | 10.00mspf (100fps) |\n|   4x |  5.81mspf (172fps) |  6.37mspf (157fps) |\n|   2x |  5.21mspf (192fps) |  5.49mspf (182fps) |\n|  off |  4.48mspf (223fps) |  4.48mspf (223fps) |\n\nPerformance tests done in the [Bistro test scene](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74965).\n\nThis PR also rearranges the post-transparent MSAA resolve visual profiler timestamps to provide a more detailed breakdown of how that time is spent.\n\nPR:\n<img width=\"513\" height=\"202\" alt=\"immagine\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3c66045-ed17-40a4-be0a-0d02f2958a37\" />\n\nMaster:\n<img width=\"478\" height=\"133\" alt=\"immagine\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57243b78-5059-4375-b5ed-511cbaf0d41c\" />\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos